// Only main runs hourly heartbeats, 2026-11-22, on Adam's yes. agents.defaults.heartbeat (every 1h,
// Haiku 5.5, isolated session) gave every agent a heartbeat: heartbeat-background and
// heartbeat-deep woke their idle main sessions every hour, had no task list and nobody to report
// to, cost Max (deep) and API credits (background), and leaked an MCP shim per run. Spawned jobs
// don't need them: sessions_spawn starts a child at once and its result comes back to main.
// "0m" stops only the recurring cadence; event wakes (a background exec finishing) still run
// (docs/gateway/heartbeat.md). Main needs its own block: once any agent has one, only agents with
// a block run heartbeats. Main's merges over the defaults, so it is unchanged. The cron watch
// needs one heartbeat, main's.
// Undo: config unset agents.entries.{main,background,deep}.heartbeat
{
  agents: {
    entries: {
      main: { heartbeat: { every: "1h" } },
      background: { heartbeat: { every: "0m" } },
      deep: { heartbeat: { every: "0m" } },
    },
  },
}
